---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Forms & Documents
description: Book lists, supply lists, applications, permission slips and athletics forms for Westside Baptist Academy families.
permalink: /families/forms/
---

<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="section__eyebrow">Current Families</span>
    <h1>Forms &amp; Documents</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">Everything the office is likely to ask you for, in one place.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose prose--wide">

      {% for group in forms.groups %}
      <h2>{{ group.group }}</h2>
      {% if group.intro %}<p>{{ group.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
      <ul class="filelist{% if group.columns %} filelist--columns{% endif %}">
        {% for item in group.items %}
        <li>
          {% if item.file %}
          <a href="/files/{{ item.file }}">
            <span class="filelist__title">{{ item.title }}</span>
            <span class="filelist__note">{% if item.note %}{{ item.note }}{% else %}PDF{% endif %}</span>
          </a>
          {% else %}
          <span class="filelist__pending">
            <span class="filelist__title">{{ item.title }}</span>
            <span class="filelist__note">Coming soon</span>
          </span>
          {% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% endfor %}

      {# A document with no file attached shows as "Coming soon" on its own,
         which is all a parent needs to know. There was a yellow editorial note
         here listing what was still missing — that was a note to the office,
         and it was being published. #}

      <h2>Trouble with a form?</h2>
      <p>Call the office at <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneHref }}">{{ site.contact.phone }}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a>. Paper copies are always available in the school office.</p>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
